# Staged build context — regenerated by `task stage-context` (copies
# Dockerfile, microvm config-fragment, and the cloud-arm64 baseline +
# cmdline patch from ../../cloud-boot/kernel into .build-ctx/). It's
# pure output and depends on a sibling repo, so versioning it would
# guarantee drift; the Taskfile rebuilds it on every run.
.build-ctx/
